# Telegram booking notifications
#
# 1. Create a bot with @BotFather → /newbot, copy the token below.
# 2. Add the bot to your channel as an administrator (it needs "Post messages").
# 3. Get the channel id: forward any channel post to @userinfobot, or open
#    https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates after posting in the channel.
#    Channel ids look like -1001234567890. A public channel also accepts @channelname.
#
# Copy this file to .env for local development, and set the same two variables
# in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables for production.

NUXT_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456789:AAAAaaaaBBBBccccDDDDeeeeFFFFgggghhh
NUXT_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=-1001234567890


